{"id": "776417", "revid": "686003", "url": "https://vi.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=776417", "title": "Cran-Gevrier", "text": "Cran-Gevrier là một xã trong tỉnh Haute-Savoie thuộc vùng Rhône-Alpes đông nam Pháp.\nGeography.\nCran-Gevrier is in the east of Annecy. Part of the city is on a hill (hill of Gevrier). The hamlet of Cran was on the level of the Thiou river. The top of the hill of Gevrier is designated as a natural preserve.\nThe Fier forms most of the commune's north-western border.\nHistory.\nThe city draws its origins from two hamlets: Cran and Gevrier. There are two possible origins for each one of these names:\nThe Romans were the first to settle on the hill. A Roman villa and a theatre were built there."}
