{"id": "776597", "revid": "686003", "url": "https://vi.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=776597", "title": "Saint-Gervais-les-Bains", "text": "Saint-Gervais-les-Bains là một xã trong tỉnh Haute-Savoie thuộc vùng Rhône-Alpes đông nam Pháp.\nThe village lies near the Tête Rousse glacier. In August 2010, a lake under the glacier at an altitude of 3200 meters had to be pumped dry to forestall a possible flood; a nineteenth-century flood caused by a lake under the same glacier killed 175 people.\nTransportation.\nThe Mont Blanc Tramway departs from \"Le Fayet\" station and reaches the \"Nid d'Aigle\" station at the Bionnassay glacier at an altitude of 2372 m (7800 ft). The Ligne de Saint Gervais - Vallorcine departs from \"Le Fayet\" station and takes you to Chamonix and across the Swiss border to Martigny."}
