{"id": "776631", "revid": "686003", "url": "https://vi.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=776631", "title": "Sixt-Fer-à-Cheval", "text": "Sixt-Fer-à-Cheval là một municipality trong tỉnh Haute-Savoie thuộc vùng Auvergne-Rhône-Alpes in southeastern Pháp.\nGeography.\nThe town ranges in altitude from , and three-quarters of its area are part of a Natural Reserve and thus completely uninhabited. The Giffre river, a tributary of the Arve, has its source in Sixt-Fer-à-Cheval, coming from numerous waterfalls in the nearby mountains.\nThe town is on the Swiss border."}
